    "answer": {
      "short": "$-\\frac{5}{3},\\; -1\\frac{1}{2},\\; -\\frac{3}{4},\\; -\\frac{1}{2},\\; -\\frac{1}{5},\\; \\frac{1}{16},\\; \\frac{3}{4},\\; 3\\frac{1}{10}$",
      "worked": "Convert to decimals:\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\frac{3}{4}&=0.75\\\\\n-\\frac{1}{2}&=-0.5\\\\\n-\\frac{5}{3}&=-1.\\overline{6}\\\\\n-\\frac{3}{4}&=-0.75\\\\\n-1\\frac{1}{2}&=-1.5\\\\\n\\frac{1}{16}&=0.0625\\\\\n-\\frac{1}{5}&=-0.2\\\\\n3\\frac{1}{10}&=3.1\n\\end{align*}$$\nIn ascending order:\n$$-1.\\overline{6}<-1.5<-0.75<-0.5<-0.2<0.0625<0.75<3.1.$$\nRewrite in the original forms:\n$$-\\frac{5}{3},\\; -1\\frac{1}{2},\\; -\\frac{3}{4},\\; -\\frac{1}{2},\\; -\\frac{1}{5},\\; \\frac{1}{16},\\; \\frac{3}{4},\\; 3\\frac{1}{10}.$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
